# v12-merlin: written by tools/cycles scenarios. Cycle table grid: holds at throttle 0.
# Each hold is 0.5 s of settling and at least 24 whole cycles; 0.25 s sweeps join the holds.
# The renderer reads cut RPM THROTTLE SECONDS as a hold with the ignition off. snarl does not read these files.
hold 600 0 5.3
sweep 600 750 0 0.25
hold 750 0 4.4
sweep 750 1000 0 0.25
hold 1000 0 3.4
sweep 1000 1250 0 0.25
hold 1250 0 2.9
sweep 1250 1500 0 0.25
hold 1500 0 2.5
sweep 1500 1750 0 0.25
hold 1750 0 2.2
sweep 1750 2000 0 0.25
hold 2000 0 2
sweep 2000 2250 0 0.25
hold 2250 0 1.8
sweep 2250 2500 0 0.25
hold 2500 0 1.7
sweep 2500 2750 0 0.25
hold 2750 0 1.6
sweep 2750 3000 0 0.25
hold 3000 0 1.5
